          <span class="text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">fix: resolve gofmt formatting and exclude metadata from web validation (64115389)</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-2">
          <span class="shrink-0 text-lg">📝</span>
          <span class="text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">refactor: standardize output flag naming and improve error context (96eadb84)</span>
        </li>
